---
description: Database and Drizzle ORM patterns
globs: ["src/lib/db/**/*.ts", "lib/db/**/*.ts", "drizzle/**/*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- All DB calls go through the lib/db abstraction layer
- Use Drizzle transactions for multi-step writes
- Always select specific fields, never select *
- Add indexes on all foreign keys and query filters
